 "name_en": "Margin Analysis (J55)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Margin Analysis (J55)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to analyze profit and contribution margins by market segment or strategic business unit, such as a sales organization or business area. You can analyze contribution margins for individual products and services, and monitor the profitability of project-based services you provide to your clients. You can also see unbilled project costs and revenues.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The cost and revenue information is always current and fully reconciled with the income statement.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">After performing allocations and top-down distributions, the application offers several reports to analyze the data.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__loiod801ac93f6404e8f80587a736ef66689_ul_kq4_24m_5bc\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run universal allocation to transfer cost center costs to market segments in margin analysis</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Post expenses to central cost center, create and execute top-down distribution cycle</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Create and execute a profitability realignment run and analyze its results</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run reports on projects: project profitability overview, project profitability, and project financial booklet – professional services</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run report on products: product profitability with production variances</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run reports for service business: solution order margins, service profitability review booklet</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run reports on market segments: market segments actual report, market segments actual versus plan report</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Run margin analysis reports across objects: display line items – margin analysis, product and service margins</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Derive reporting dimensions (market segments) in real-time</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Ensure cost and revenue information is always current and fully reconciled with the income statement</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Gain more insight into the profitability of market segments (product, customer, customer orders, projects) or strategic business units (sales organizations, business areas) with respect to your company's profit or contribution margin</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Offer predefined financial KPIs and adaptable views on customer projects, projects with revenues, and overhead projects</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>利润分析 (J55)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够按市场细分或战略业务单位（例如销售组织或业务范围）分析利润和边际收益。您可以分析各个产品和服务的边际收益，并监控您提供给客户的基于项目的服务的获利能力。您还可以查看未开票的项目成本和收入。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">成本和收入信息始终是最新的，并与损益表完全一致。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">执行分配和自上而下分配后，应用程序将提供多个报表来分析数据。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__loiod801ac93f6404e8f80587a736ef66689_ul_kq4_24m_5bc\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">运行通用分配，将成本中心成本传输到利润分析中的市场细分</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">将费用过账到中央成本中心，创建并执行自上而下分配周期</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">创建和执行获利能力重新调整运行，并分析其结果</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">运行项目报表：项目获利能力概览、项目获利能力和项目财务手册 - 专业服务</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">运行产品报表：含生产差异的产品获利能力</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">运行服务业务报表：解决方案订单利润、服务获利能力审核手册</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">针对市场细分运行报表：市场细分实际报表、市场细分实际与计划报表</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">跨对象运行利润分析报告：显示行项目 - 利润分析、产品和服务利润</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof591a52b172b41498a5d6b8d09b6ea93__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">实时派生报表维度（市场细分）</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">确保成本和收入信息始终是最新的，并与损益表完全一致</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">根据公司的利润或边际收益，更深入地了解市场细分（产品、客户、客户订单、项目）或战略业务单位（销售组织、业务范围）的获利能力</p></li>\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">提供有关客户项目、有收入的项目和间接费用项目的预定义财务 KPI 和可调整视图</p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
